            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-n",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "o",
            "prompt": "$3^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\times3^{\\frac{1}{5}}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$3^{\\frac{8}{15}}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\times3^{\\frac{1}{5}}&=3^{\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{5}}\\\\&=3^{\\frac{5}{15}+\\frac{3}{15}}\\\\&=3^{\\frac{8}{15}}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-o",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "p",
            "prompt": "$3^{a}\\times3^{a}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$3^{2a}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{a}\\times3^{a}&=3^{a+a}\\\\&=3^{2a}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-p",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "q",
            "prompt": "$3^{a}\\times3^{b}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$3^{a+b}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{a}\\times3^{b}&=3^{a+b}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 8
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-q",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "r",
            "prompt": "$a^{3}\\times b^{3}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$(ab)^{3}$",
              "worked": "The bases differ, so the same-base multiplication law does not apply. Expand and regroup the factors:\n$$\\begin{align*}a^{3}\\times b^{3}&=(a\\times a\\times a)(b\\times b\\times b)\\\\&=(ab)(ab)(ab)\\\\&=(ab)^{3}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-r",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "s",
            "prompt": "$a^{3}\\times a^{3}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$a^{6}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a^{3}\\times a^{3}&=a^{3+3}\\\\&=a^{6}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q4-right-final-k",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "t",
            "prompt": "$\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{3}\\times\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{3}=$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{6}$",
              "worked": "For $a\\ne0$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{3}\\times\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{3}&=\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{3+3}\\\\&=\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^{6}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          }
        ]
      }
